abstract: >-
  Analysis and figure code for a study of the plasma extracellular
  particle-enriched proteome before and after 12 weeks of combined endurance
  and resistance training (MyoGlu). Includes the numeric source data behind
  the figure panels. Contains no clinical phenotype data.
keywords:
